unknown' boot failure; fixes mis-selection of a hardware-FP8 kernel on a non-FP8 arch\",\"accuracy_risk\":\"none\",\"domain_tags\":[\"vllm\",\"rocm\",\"fp8\",\"gfx90a\",\"kernel-selection\"]},\n{\"what\":\"Triton tl.dot on float8_e4m3fn inputs DOES execute on gfx90a (Triton 3.7.1; ~9.7 TFLOPS native-fp8 path, ~32 TFLOPS when upcast to bf16), so a Triton FP8 w8a8 GEMM is a viable enablement bridge where torch._scaled_mm is not\",\"source\":\"local probe on GPU7: scratch/t_fp8.py\",\"expected_impact\":\"Unblocks boot without dequantizing ~400GB of FP8 weights to BF16 (which would OOM: 8x64GB HBM)\",\"accuracy_risk\":\"low (fp32 accumulate, per-token/per-channel dequant identical to the intended ChannelWiseTorch math)\",\"domain_tags\":[\"triton\",\"rocm\",\"fp8\",\"enablement\"]}],\n \"proposal_set\":[],\"patches_written\":[],\"residual_questions\":[],\"artifacts_written\":[]}}\nd=\"/home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/session/Ornith-1.5-397B-FP8/20260915T150443Z-6b7d597b/runs/specialist/38272543d24d40a5ad7455d3b42904f2\"\nopen(d+\"/specialist_done.partial.json.tmp\",\"w\").write(json.dumps(p,indent=1))\nos.rename(d+\"/specialist_done.partial.json.tmp\", d+\"/specialist_done.partial.json\")\nprint(\"partial written\")\nPY","description":"Write initial checkpoint"}}],"model":"qwen3.8-flash-next","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6d8d162a-aacb-49eb-8d41-ca88b571bdc8","uuid":"6159668b-99e3-4460-8257-1a762c30bc73"}
